msgstr "mojado"

#. What a target with this effect is, e.g.: "If {condition}: stuns for 2 turns."
msgctxt "effect.soak.condition"
msgid "soaked"
msgstr "empapado"

#. What the effect does to its target, e.g.: "{verb}: 50% less damage from burn for 2 turns."
msgctxt "effect.soak.verb"
msgid "Soaks"
msgstr "Empapa"

#. The name of the effect, as the title of its effect info, e.g.: "Venom x2".
